    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald O Donovan offer for sale this 3 bedroom well maintained property located in the popular Pairc an Oir development in Rathcormac village. This B energy rated property extends to approximately 92 sq. m. of living accommodation and benefits from a private driveway to the front and spacious rear garden. The property also overlooks a large green area to the front. Located within a 20 minute commute of the Jack Lynch Tunnel and only 5 mins from Fermoy town, the village of Rathcormac boasts a number of excellent amenities including modern primary school, thriving GAA club, regular bus service to Cork/Fermoy, children's playground, shops, service station which are all within walking distance of the property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 5.1m x 1.9m\nTiled flooring. Radiator.\n\nKitchen/Dining Area - 3.40m x 5.56m\nFloor and splashback tiling. Wall and floor kitchen units. Radiator. Radiator. Sliding patio door leading to rear garden.\n\nGuest Wc - 0.9m x 1.5m\nTiled flooring. Wc., whb.\n\nSitting Room - 4.81m x 3.45m\nLaminate flooring. Solid fuel open fireplace. Radiator.\n\nUpstairs - \n\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.2m x 3.3m\nLaminate flooring. Radiator.\n\nEnsuite - 2.3m x 1m\nTiled flooring. Wc., whb., electric shower.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.4m x 3.3m\nLaminate flooring. Radiator.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.5m x 2.4m\nLaminate flooring. Radiator.\n\nBathroom - 2.1m x 2m\nTiled flooring. Wc., whb., bath.\n\n"
      },
      {
